# Ideal logical CNOT 1 -> 2 within one already-encoded Gross block.
# Qubits 0..143 are data; 144 is an UNENCODED ancilla; 145 is a check ancilla.
# Requires input in the code space. Not a fault-tolerant hardware schedule.
# First two measurements return u,v; third returns w.
# Record-controlled gates implement the Pauli corrections.
RX 144
R 145
CX 15 145 17 145 18 145 21 145 22 145 23 145 81 145 83 145 84 145 88 145 92 145 94 145 144 145
M 145
RX 145
CX 145 3 145 6 145 12 145 15 145 18 145 24 145 39 145 42 145 48 145 51 145 54 145 60 145 144
MX 145
M 144
